<title>JAPAN: Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Kudo Corp.</title>
<headline>Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Kudo Corp.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Thursday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Kudo Corp, a construction firm, on the TSE's second section.</p>
<p>Kudo Corp is likely to be listed on April 11, and it plans to issue one million new shares, the TSE said.</p>
